; benchmark.meta description: Holds Living Herbarium's 1,000 specimens at fit while 5% of them sway in deform mode with gradients, the demo's defaults, in a real 1440 x 900 window at scale 2 with its toolbar and stats panel, reporting each committed frame's main-thread phases and GPU time.
; benchmark.meta timing: not-recommended
; benchmark.meta profiles: gui-window
